    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454945add1e0b519e3cc80ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽在“有马纪念”上\n成功赢过了超级溪流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cdc8157db2494e7c68c4287eb790d25efb812815d7ab4321c3fac90ae294c5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65be7a93de96c95466906d4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛后，来到休息室的玉藻十字\n宣布将放弃挑战“梦想杯”，\n与两人一较高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9712b026a865d9da0c97924055703dc935065a50a4ee5c22f7a3fed8ff277e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096f3021c733199d444b0bf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽因意想不到的劲敌登场感到消沉。\n她面对全新考验的日子即将拉开序幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73622069d15e22336acb9352fce07ebbc877dde63d5fff5a2540bfa55d837156",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
