    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d94c2f9e9ae0a72ac921120",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人互相吐露心声后，\n再度成为了朋友以及劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dadf676ccbed4d27a8852a77cc1d0afeea035a58de3e07708a75c85ca4385de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c6456c47ab6ff9bbd51f0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人所迈向的“前方”",
      "source_fingerprint": "75373d41b88ab9cc4d004934763131ee06f92ee8432b20e9bb5b51261bc1be8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:635c83b2583e14ca08846edd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字在“天皇赏（春）”\n上演了个人秀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21975e656e3ad3ca9c87348c5635abe217dfab26d27bfc0643b8b6ee6b960fff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e49e028e3ad293b292cd19a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看见她疾风迅雷般的跑姿，\n小栗帽燃起了斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0459d0cfdba601671d7bf2ef563980743cee394ce030b43b69d38a2259058e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
