      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，决定最强的胜负之争才刚刚开始──\n两人约好在秋季的天皇赏再次较量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a85969358a527f956fbd82f839cf531bd89105ee741cc31bcf1ad8556e252e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
