      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为在GⅠ比赛上拿出精彩表现的犒赏，\n小栗帽被带去了餐厅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406de671b25e38da6279f710f8dda2d336392ec915eee2e6f86656127966fc28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
