    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d41c15ecb19c16edbf98fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第三年的“夏季集训”。\n虽然小栗帽接到了外出用餐的邀约──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9876e5d47bdcd00215d6a9259bfc847426f1bbb77b8e7fcb750cd2628226d8d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c25de59e99c2a5f09ad1d5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "却表示想先进行训练，\n让人感受到她的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34eeaa4ad3eb5bb613476de76553c250ae27d5eb472a0878d607d5ba6661a8b3",
