      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”──\n与其挚友玉藻十字对决的时刻到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8452bcda30b5bd7658c51d040c237e3c0ff13a077d80cc2231e303e82de3a25e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
