      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对向她宣战的小栗帽，\n玉藻十字也表示自己不会输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5549a0b81b996c0709c5b18ba6cf2c8c093234cddd85a65f80d3d08184595723",
