      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“天皇赏（秋）”的盛大舞台上，\n小栗帽击败了玉藻十字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d26c2290448e33724ceb22e6c09f37a9780f77603d0af2be103ad68139fde8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
