      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着还有超级溪流也会参赛的\n最后决战“有马纪念”在等着她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da37c299d3e052aa42c3c5ab252abbef2d09e8c51ecd82f4c119bf7a916ae53",
