    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc97ca126affc1af9a1dbfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・灰毛的怪物，挺身而立",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dff87173f5d989bbae2882ac667d6a0115c0a02539a9ee47cadb3cdb790ff0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6bf72d401791cea983b99f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练的休息时间，\n小栗帽在和后辈赛马娘说话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f16a6fb86e1b0015e04997ce9c91a5b5714f7d5d5a597c4743ac6b05c8511ac5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006500.json",
